msgstr "Journal effacé."

msgid "Log entries"
msgstr "Entrées de journal"

msgid ""
"Log into your YOURLS admin area, open Manage Plugins, and activate “kURL "
"Helper”."
msgstr ""
"Connectez-vous à l’administration YOURLS, ouvrez Manage Plugins et activez « "
"kURL Helper »."

